IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aac-rules`

-- Adelaide Airport Curfew Act 2000 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`other` MEANS `another aircraft`
`intl` MEANS `an international aircraft with the Minister's shoulder-period permission`

GIVEN mv IS A `Movement`, h IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, k IS A `Aircraft kind`
GIVETH A `Curfew case`
`a` mv `at` h `hours` m `by` k MEANS
    `Curfew case` OF mv, h, m, k, FALSE, `none`, NOTHING

-- s 3: 11 pm to 6 am
#ASSERT `it is in the curfew` (`a` `landing` `at` 23 `hours` 0 `by` `other`)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is in the curfew` (`a` `landing` `at` 22 `hours` 59 `by` `other`))
#ASSERT `it is in the curfew` (`a` `landing` `at` 5 `hours` 59 `by` `other`)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is in the curfew` (`a` `landing` `at` 6 `hours` 0 `by` `other`))
-- s 6
#ASSERT `I commit the offence` (`a` `landing` `at` 2 `hours` 0 `by` `other`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`a` `landing` `at` 2 `hours` 0 `by` `a propeller aircraft of 34,000 kg or less meeting the Annex noise standards`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`a` `take-off` `at` 2 `hours` 0 `by` `a jet of 34,000 kg or less of a type the regulations specify`))
-- s 9: shoulder periods only
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`a` `landing` `at` 23 `hours` 30 `by` `intl`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`a` `take-off` `at` 5 `hours` 15 `by` `intl`))
#ASSERT `I commit the offence` (`a` `landing` `at` 2 `hours` 0 `by` `intl`)
-- s 14
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`Curfew case` OF `take-off`, 23, 10, `other`, TRUE, `none`, NOTHING))
#ASSERT `I commit the offence` (`Curfew case` OF `landing`, 23, 10, `other`, TRUE, `none`, NOTHING)
-- ss 16-17
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit the offence` (`Curfew case` OF `landing`, 2, 0, `other`, FALSE, `a declared in-flight emergency`, NOTHING))
#ASSERT (`the curfew position for` (`a` `landing` `at` 2 `hours` 0 `by` `other`))'s `maximum penalty units` EQUALS 200
-- s 15(3)
#ASSERT `the return deadline for` (`Curfew case` OF `landing`, 23, 30, `intl`, FALSE, `none`, JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 17 3 2026)
